---
// Careers page
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Careers — Borion AI</title>
<meta name="description" content="Join Borion AI. We're hiring MLOps engineers to build production AI systems for enterprise clients.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root{
    --navy: #141e42;
    --navy-deep: #0b1230;
    --blue: #195add;
    --purple: #6f5dd2;
    --lavender: #d2ccf1;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --muted: rgba(210, 204, 241, 0.72);
    --line: rgba(210, 204, 241, 0.12);
    --font-display: 'Inter Tight', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body{ margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body{
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Nav */
  .nav{
    padding: 20px 60px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .nav img{ height: 40px; }
  .nav-links{ display:flex; gap:28px; font-size:14px; }
  .nav-links a{ color: var(--muted); text-decoration:none; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .nav-links a:hover{ color: var(--white); }
  .nav-links .btn{
    background: var(--blue);
    color: white;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .nav-links .btn:hover{ background: var(--purple); color: white; }

  /* Hero */
  .hero{
    padding: 120px 60px 80px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-badge{
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(25, 90, 221, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(25, 90, 221, 0.3);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .pulse-dot{
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--blue);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; }
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .hero p{
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 48px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Role section */
  .role{
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 60px 80px;
  }
  .role h2{
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--lavender);
  }
  .role-meta{
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .role-meta span{
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .role-content{
    background: rgba(210, 204, 241, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
  }
  .role-content h3{
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--lavender);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .role-content p{
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .role-content ul{
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .role-content li{
    padding-left: 24px;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .role-content li::before{
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta{
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 60px 120px;
  }
  .cta-box{
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(25, 90, 221, 0.12), rgba(111, 93, 210, 0.12));
    border: 1px solid rgba(111, 93, 210, 0.3);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 48px 40px;
  }
  .cta-box h3{
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .cta-box p{
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .cta-email{
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .cta-email:hover{
    background: var(--purple);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* Footer */
  footer{
    padding: 40px 60px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  footer a{
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  footer a:hover{ color: var(--white); }
  .foot-links{ display: flex; gap: 24px; }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px){
    .nav{ padding: 16px 24px; }
    .nav-links{ display: none; }
    .hero{ padding: 80px 24px 60px; }
    .role{ padding: 0 24px 60px; }
    .role-content{ padding: 32px 24px; }
    .cta{ padding: 40px 24px 80px; }
    .cta-box{ padding: 40px 28px; }
    footer{
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }
    .foot-links{ flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Nav -->
<nav class="nav">
  <a href="/">
    <img src="/BORION-02.png" alt="BorionAI" />
  </a>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="/#about">About</a>
    <a href="/#services">Services</a>
    <a href="/insights">Insights</a>
    <a href="/careers">Careers</a>
    <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Book a Call</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">
    <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
    Now Hiring
  </div>
  <h1>Build Production AI That Actually Ships</h1>
  <p>Join a team that deploys enterprise AI systems in 90 days — not quarters. We work with Fortune 500 clients who pay for outcomes, not effort.</p>
</section>

<!-- Role -->
<section class="role">
  <h2>MLOps Engineer</h2>
  <div class="role-meta">
    <span>📍 Remote (Global)</span>
    <span>⏰ Full-time</span>
  </div>

  <div class="role-content">
    <h3>What You'll Do</h3>
    <p>You'll be responsible for taking research-grade models and turning them into production systems that run at enterprise scale. This isn't about maintaining pipelines — it's about building the infrastructure that makes AI deployment actually work.</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Design and implement production ML pipelines for Fortune 500 deployments</li>
      <li>Build monitoring, retraining, and deployment systems that survive real-world conditions</li>
      <li>Work directly with data scientists and clients to translate prototypes into scalable systems</li>
      <li>Own the full stack: from model serving to CI/CD to observability</li>
      <li>Ship working systems in 60–90 day cycles, not 12-month roadmaps</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>What We're Looking For</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>3+ years building and deploying production ML systems</li>
      <li>Deep experience with ML infrastructure: model serving, feature stores, monitoring</li>
      <li>Strong software engineering fundamentals (Python, containerization, cloud platforms)</li>
      <li>Comfortable working directly with clients and translating business needs into technical specs</li>
      <li>Track record of shipping systems that run in production for months, not days</li>
      <li>Bias toward pragmatism over perfection — you ship working solutions, then iterate</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>What We Offer</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Work on real problems for companies you've heard of</li>
      <li>Performance-based compensation — we get paid when systems deploy, and so do you</li>
      <li>Remote-first, async work culture (we don't do standup theater)</li>
      <li>Small team, high autonomy — you'll own entire systems, not tickets</li>
      <li>Learn from practitioners who've built AI infrastructure at Shell, AB InBev, Keurig Dr Pepper</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Our Stack</h3>
    <p>Python · Docker · Kubernetes · AWS/GCP/Azure · MLflow/Kubeflow · PostgreSQL · FastAPI · GitHub Actions · Terraform</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8;">We adapt to client environments — expect to work across different tech stacks.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta">
  <div class="cta-box">
    <h3>Interested?</h3>
    <p>Send us your resume and a brief note about a production ML system you've built. No cover letter required — just tell us what you shipped and what went wrong.</p>
    <a href="mailto:careers@borion.ai" class="cta-email">Apply: careers@borion.ai</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer>
  <div>© 2026 Borion AI. Built for deployment.</div>
  <div class="foot-links">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <a href="/insights">Insights</a>
    <a href="/careers">Careers</a>
    <a href="mailto:team@borion.ai">Contact</a>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
